": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudio"}, "order": 24}, {"outputs": [{"name": "VIDEO", "links": [930], "label": "VIDEO", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "视频"}], "widgets_values": [24, 8, "sRGB", "none"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 928, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio", "link": 929, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "fps"}, "name": "fps", "label": "fps", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "帧率"}, {"widget": {"name": "bit_depth"}, "shape": 7, "name": "bit_depth", "label": "bit_depth", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "bit_depth"}, {"widget": {"name": "color_space"}, "shape": 7, "name": "color_space", "label": "color_space", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "color_space"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec"}, "shape": 7, "name": "codec", "label": "codec", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "codec"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CreateVideo", "title": "合成视频（画面 + 原生音频）", "mode": 0, "size": [270, 150], "pos": [3379.4958321289055, 55.08961782358815], "id": 609, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CreateVideo"}, "order": 25, "widgets_values_named": {"codec": "none", "fps": 24, "bit_depth": 8, "color_space": "sRGB"}}, {"outputs": [{"name": "video_url", "links": [], "label": "video_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video"}, {"name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}], "widgets_values": ["video/MiniMax_H3_RH", "auto", "auto", "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "video", "link": 930, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "视频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "格式"}, {"widget": {"name": "format.codec"}, "name": "format.codec", "label": "format.codec", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "编解码器"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec"}, "shape": 7, "name": "codec", "label": "codec", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "编码器"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveVideo", "title": "保存成品视频", "mode": 0, "size": [1393.6341135199655, 2627.3543179764097], "pos": [3042.8316199869796, 325.55298950805695], "id": 610, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveVideo"}, "order": 26, "widgets_values_named": {"codec": "auto", "filename_prefix": "video/MiniMax_H3_RH", "format": "auto", "format.codec": "auto"}}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# MiniMAX H3 · RH 官方核心整理版\n\n这条工作流只使用 ComfyUI 官方核心节点：多图参考由 `MiniMax H3 Reference to Video` 原生处理，输出由 `CreateVideo → SaveVideo` 完成。\n\n## 使用顺序\n\n1. 在左侧四个「参考图」节点中替换素材。提示词里的 `<Picture 1>` 至 `<Picture 4>` 依次对应这四张图。\n2. 在「提示词」节点直接修改分镜、角色和镜头描述。\n3. 修改「时长（秒）」；帧数会自动按 24fps、17 帧块向上对齐。\n4. 在「分辨率」选择画幅和 MP。当前默认 0.5MP，16:9 输出为 960×544。\n5. 点击运行；成品在「保存成品视频」。\n\n## 当前默认值\n\n- 时长：10 秒\n- 对齐帧数：243 帧\n- 分辨率：960×544，16:9\n- 采样：Euler / Simple / 4 步\n- 模型：Ref2VA INT8 + DMAD 4步 LoRA + 人物一致性 LoRA\n- 音视频：直接解码 H3 的 AV latent，保留原生音频\n\n## 扩展视频/音频参考\n\n原生 H3 节点的 `ref_videos`、`ref_video_audios` 和 `ref_audios` 槽位已保留。需要时接入官方视频/音频加载节点，并在提示词中使用 `<Video 1>`、`<Audio 1>` 等标签。\n\n## 上传前检查\n\n- 四个图片文件名必须是上传到 RunningHub 后存在的输入文件。\n- 主模型、Qwen3-VL、视频/音频 VAE 和两个 LoRA 文件必须在模型库中。\n- 本版不依赖 T8、Muye、孤海、VHS、KJ、SelfLift 等第三方节点。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [1080, 390], "pos": [0, -500], "id": 611, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "# MiniMAX H3 · RH 官方核心整理版\n\n这条工作流只使用 ComfyUI 官方核心节点：多图参考由 `MiniMax H3 Reference to Video` 原生处理，输出由 `CreateVideo → SaveVideo` 完成。\n\n## 使用顺序\n\n1. 在左侧四个「参考图」节点中替换素材。提示词里的 `<Picture 1>` 至 `<Picture 4>` 依次对应这四张图。\n2. 在「提示词」节点直接修改分镜、角色和镜头描述。\n3. 修改「时长（秒）」；帧数会自动按 24fps、17 帧块向上对齐。\n4. 在「分辨率」选择画幅和 MP。当前默认 0.5MP，16:9 输出为 960×544。\n5. 点击运行；成品在「保存成品视频」。\n\n## 当前默认值\n\n- 时长：10 秒\n- 对齐帧数：243 帧\n- 分辨率：960×544，16:9\n- 采样：Euler / Simple / 4 步\n- 模型：Ref2VA INT8 + DMAD 4步 LoRA + 人物一致性 LoRA\n- 音视频：直接解码 H3 的 AV latent，保留原生音频\n\n## 扩展视频/音频参考\n\n原生 H3 节点的 `ref_videos`、`ref_video_audios` 和 `ref_audios` 槽位已保留。需要时接入官方视频/音频加载节点，并在提示词中使用 `<Video 1>`、`<Audio 1>` 等标签。\n\n## 上传前检查\n\n- 四个图片文件名必须是上传到 RunningHub 后存在的输入文件。\n- 主模型、Qwen3-VL、视频/音频 VAE 和两个 LoRA 文件必须在模型库中。\n- 本版不依赖 T8、Muye、孤海、VHS、KJ、SelfLift 等第三方节点。\n"}}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "frontendVersion": "1.49.6", "ds": {"offset": [639.263233185779, 594.1676734237199], "scale": 0.5989500000000022}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "① 参考图输入（4图）", "bounding": [-40, -55, 790, 1010]}, {"color": "#b08a4a", "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "② 提示词 / 时长 / 分辨率", "bounding": [-40, 980, 1000, 1080]}, {"color": "#5a9e6f", "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "③ 模型 / LoRA / 原生优化", "bounding": [1050, -55, 540, 1060]}, {"color": "#c0707a", "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "④ 官方 4步采样", "bounding": [1740, -55, 1180, 1110]}, {"color": "#8a8f99", "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "⑤ 解码 / 合成 / 保存", "bounding": [3040, -55, 1410.0657186089406, 1819.1111449957948]}], "links": [[900, 388, 0, 431, 0, "MODEL"], [901, 431, 0, 432, 0, "MODEL"], [902, 432, 0, 365, 0, "MODEL"], [903, 365, 0, 361, 0, "MODEL"], [904, 361, 0, 603, 0, "MODEL"], [905, 361, 0, 605, 0, "MODEL"], [918, 601, 0, 603, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [919, 601, 1, 606, 4, "LATENT"], [920, 602, 0, 606, 0, "NOISE"], [921, 603, 0, 606, 1, "GUIDER"], [922, 604, 0, 606, 2, "SAMPLER"], [923, 605, 0, 606, 3, "SIGMAS"], [924, 606, 0, 607, 0, "LATENT"], [925, 606, 0, 608, 0, "LATENT"], [926, 397, 0, 607, 1, "VAE"], [927, 398, 0, 608, 1, "VAE"], [928, 607, 0, 609, 0, "IMAGE"], [929, 608, 0, 609, 1, "AUDIO"], [916, 3